      "lessons": [
        "Enterprise-grade quant platform uses modular ML architecture supporting diverse paradigms (supervised, RL, market dynamics) to accommodate varied research approaches and production needs.",
        "Integration of LLM-powered autonomous agents (RD-Agent) for automating factor discovery and hyperparameter optimization demonstrates shift toward AI-driven research automation in quant finance.",
        "Comprehensive data infrastructure (Point-in-Time database, multiple providers, Arctic backend) is critical for quantitative finance platforms handling temporal market data with strict consistency requirements.",
        "Rich ecosystem of pre-trained models and frameworks (HIST, KRNN, meta-learning, high-frequency trading) suggests platform designed for both research exploration and production deployment at scale."
